<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1729853527"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kira Killer (feat. Mori Calliope)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.380"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">连迎合周围的语言都不懂</text><text for="L2">守备力虽弱，直觉却很敏锐</text><text for="L3">一旦被推着前进，就停下</text><text for="L4">暂且像棉花一样</text><text for="L5">弯折吧，向着更高的地方，晃晃悠悠地摇曳</text><text for="L6">马上就要出乱子了，就当是过度呼吸（breath）吧</text><text for="L7">这样的原罪人生，持盾握矛，纠结缠斗是必修课</text><text for="L8">没有截稿日的话，话语就会不断增殖</text><text for="L9">没有思绪，脑袋空空，在虚无中围成一圈</text><text for="L10">在混沌与安宁中为你献上</text><text for="L11">不去做想放弃的事就无法满足的我</text><text for="L12">够震撼吧？"理想人生？"你正活在里头</text><text for="L13">"反正是打工，哪里不都一样吗？"</text><text for="L14">绮罗杀手</text><text for="L15">讨厌什么的才只是开头，这么一想就轻松了</text><text for="L16">3、2、1，彼此扭曲着纠缠</text><text for="L17">你那张嘴，叼着辛辣的香烟</text><text for="L18">虽然早已看开了</text><text for="L19">管他呢？有汁就喝干，我们依然硬气</text><text for="L20">是最烂的心结（コンプ：劣等感/完成/压缩），也是最好的昆布高汤</text><text for="L21">光是凑齐了，多没意思啊</text><text for="L22">就算连在一起也会散开，咸涩的柴鱼片</text><text for="L23">好想再多撒撒娇啊——？</text><text for="L24">敷衍了事、起起落落的现状，如今正当红</text><text for="L25">越消沉反而越能前进的道理</text><text for="L26">up 一下又 down 一下的成长，还差那么一点</text><text for="L27">好想被"谷底之巅"的滋味填满啊</text><text for="L28">我不想再写词，也不想再握麦克风</text><text for="L29">是那些反馈让我止步</text><text for="L30">我跌落谷底，得去买杯大牌咖啡</text><text for="L31">想来"风格"的时代早已远去</text><text for="L32">多谢啦，感觉会喜欢上你的歌</text><text for="L33">虽然我早已过气，却依然不够</text><text for="L34">把歌词当过期罐头一样抛洒</text><text for="L35">平凡的家伙红过了头，我完蛋了（烤焦了）</text><text for="L36">把苦涩情绪洒满网络，再把球门柱挪走</text><text for="L37">磨磨蹭蹭、多愁善感的消极思维</text><text for="L38">没有人过来，我却还在哭喊"Red Rover（快过来）"</text><text for="L39">（什么？）</text><text for="L40">不是每句都能击中人心</text><text for="L41">说着"我想你……"的那些瞬间</text><text for="L42">做个无名之辈，因为没谁拥有善意</text><text for="L43">真该让自己</text><text for="L44">当着所有人的面，松一口气</text><text for="L45">或许会变回无名小卒。你猜怎么着？</text><text for="L46">无所谓</text><text for="L47">在宏大的蓝图里，人做着梦，从不需要安眠药</text><text for="L48">"咸涩的梦"，再见了</text><text for="L49">能遇见你，真好</text><text for="L50">闪亮亮</text><text for="L51">讨厌什么的才只是开头，这么一想就轻松了</text><text for="L52">3、2、1，彼此扭曲着纠缠</text><text for="L53">你那张嘴，叼着辛辣的香烟</text><text for="L54">虽然早已看开了</text><text for="L55">管他呢？有汁就喝干，我们依然硬气</text><text for="L56">是最烂的心结（コンプ：劣等感/完成/压缩），也是最好的昆布高汤</text><text for="L57">光是凑齐了，多没意思啊</text><text for="L58">就算连在一起也会散开，咸涩的柴鱼片</text><text for="L59">好想再多撒撒娇啊——？</text><text for="L60">晃啊——晃啊——</text><text for="L61">晃啊——晃啊——</text><text for="L62">晃啊——晃啊——</text><text for="L63">晃啊——晃啊——</text><text for="L64">出道之初的粗粝冲动，就在这里</text><text for="L65">一副像是学到了、其实没学到的语气</text><text for="L66">过期的"like a loneliness"（像点赞一样轻浮的孤独），我接受</text><text for="L67">想把素颜的自己送给你</text><text for="L68">可你会看腻的吧，那就把它当养分</text><text for="L69">Yummy（暗）能量，一直帮衬着我呢</text><text for="L70">绮罗绮罗</text><text for="L71">罗鬼罗鬼（Like it, Like it）</text><text for="L72">讨——厌什么的才只是开头，这么一想就轻松了</text><text for="L73">3、2、1，彼此扭曲着纠缠</text><text for="L74">你——的那张嘴，叼着辛辣的香烟</text><text for="L75">虽然早已看开了</text><text for="L76">管他呢？知道就喝干，我们依然硬气</text><text for="L77">永远是个实习生，价值小得像小行星</text><text for="L78">也没有驾驭它的必要</text><text for="L79">和你共感就是赢，嚼一嚼，就是音之友（おともだち）</text><text for="L80">好想再多撒撒娇啊——？</text><text for="L81">晃呀晃呀晃啊——晃啊——</text><text for="L82">晃呀晃呀晃啊——晃啊——</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter><songwriter>Mori Calliope</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:13.067"><div begin="14.242" end="28.024" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.242" end="16.029" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.242" end="14.669">周りに</span><span begin="14.669" end="15.065">合わせる</span><span begin="15.065" end="15.487">言語も</span><span begin="15.487" end="16.029">知らねえ</span></p><p begin="16.039" end="17.714" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.039" end="16.564">守備力は</span><span begin="16.564" end="17.104">弱いけど</span><span begin="17.104" end="17.387">勘は</span><span begin="17.387" end="17.714">鋭</span></p><p begin="17.724" end="19.349" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.724" end="18.140">一旦</span><span begin="18.140" end="18.892">進められたら</span><span begin="18.892" end="19.108">止ま</span><span begin="19.108" end="19.349">れ</span></p><p begin="19.359" end="20.835" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.359" end="19.721">いったん</span><span begin="19.721" end="20.024">木綿</span><span begin="20.024" end="20.161">み</span><span begin="20.161" end="20.607">たい</span><span begin="20.607" end="20.835">に</span></p><p begin="20.835" end="22.762" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.835" end="21.318">曲がれ</span><span begin="21.318" end="21.664">まだ上</span> <span begin="21.664" end="22.287">ゆらゆら</span><span begin="22.287" end="22.762">揺らして</span></p><p begin="22.772" end="24.521" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.772" end="23.473">すぐとらぶるぜ</span> <span begin="23.473" end="23.900">過呼吸(ブレス)</span><span begin="23.900" end="24.000">と</span><span begin="24.000" end="24.521">心得</span></p><p begin="24.531" end="28.024" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.531" end="24.677">って</span><span begin="24.677" end="25.488">原罪人生</span> <span begin="25.488" end="26.150">盾と矛で</span> <span begin="26.312" end="26.817">葛藤の</span><span begin="26.817" end="27.336">活動が</span><span begin="27.336" end="27.561">マス</span><span begin="27.561" end="28.024">ト</span></p></div><div begin="28.095" end="41.310" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="28.095" end="32.693" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.095" end="28.610">締め</span><span begin="28.610" end="29.010">切ら</span><span begin="29.010" end="29.485">れなきゃ</span><span begin="29.485" end="30.135">言葉</span><span begin="30.135" end="30.378">が</span><span begin="30.378" end="30.739">増</span><span begin="30.739" end="32.693">殖</span></p><p begin="31.174" end="32.933" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="31.174" end="31.301">No</span> <span begin="31.301" end="31.536">thoughts,</span> <span begin="31.536" end="31.704">head</span> <span begin="31.704" end="32.070">empty</span> <span begin="32.070" end="32.426">虚無で</span><span begin="32.426" end="32.746">円</span><span begin="32.746" end="32.933">陣</span></p><p begin="32.943" end="34.604" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="32.943" end="33.167">Brought</span> <span begin="33.167" end="33.267">to</span> <span begin="33.267" end="33.367">you</span> <span begin="33.367" end="33.490">in</span> <span begin="33.490" end="33.649">chaos</span> <span begin="33.649" end="33.749">and</span> <span begin="33.749" end="34.604">serenity</span></p><p begin="34.064" end="39.777" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.064" end="34.488">やめ</span><span begin="34.488" end="34.813">たい</span><span begin="34.915" end="35.597">ことを</span><span begin="35.597" end="35.978">やらな</span><span begin="35.978" end="36.213">きゃ</span><span begin="36.213" end="37.016">満たされ</span><span begin="37.016" end="37.537">ない</span><span begin="37.537" end="39.777">僕</span></p><p begin="37.977" end="39.788" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="37.977" end="38.368">Shockin',</span> <span begin="38.368" end="38.494">isn't</span> <span begin="38.494" end="38.619">it?</span> <span begin="38.619" end="38.891">"Dream</span> <span begin="38.891" end="39.132">life?"</span> <span begin="39.132" end="39.286">You're</span> <span begin="39.286" end="39.410">livin'</span> <span begin="39.410" end="39.788">it</span></p><p begin="39.788" end="41.310" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="39.788" end="40.028">"バイト</span><span begin="40.028" end="40.467">だったら</span><span begin="40.467" end="40.835">どこでも</span><span begin="40.835" end="41.310">よくない？"</span></p></div><div begin="41.320" end="1:09.352" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="41.320" end="42.607" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.320" end="41.920">綺羅</span><span begin="41.920" end="42.131">キ</span><span begin="42.131" end="42.607">ラー</span></p><p begin="42.900" end="46.325" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.900" end="43.348">嫌い</span><span begin="43.348" end="43.833">なんて</span><span begin="43.833" end="44.249">序の</span><span begin="44.249" end="44.739">口</span> <span begin="44.755" end="45.081">そう</span><span begin="45.081" end="45.535">思うと</span><span begin="45.535" end="45.965">楽</span><span begin="45.965" end="46.151">だ</span><span begin="46.151" end="46.325">し</span></p><p begin="46.325" end="49.761" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.325" end="46.796">3.</span><span begin="46.796" end="47.244">2.</span><span begin="47.244" end="47.676">1</span><span begin="47.676" end="47.911">で</span><span begin="47.911" end="48.529">歪</span><span begin="48.529" end="48.961">み</span><span begin="48.961" end="49.412">合っ</span><span begin="49.412" end="49.761">た</span></p><p begin="49.771" end="53.104" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.771" end="50.403">君</span><span begin="50.403" end="50.590">の</span><span begin="50.590" end="51.040">その</span><span begin="51.040" end="51.471">口</span> <span begin="51.497" end="52.256">シガレット</span><span begin="52.256" end="52.707">辛</span><span begin="52.707" end="53.104">口</span></p><p begin="53.114" end="56.161" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.114" end="53.948">割り</span><span begin="53.948" end="54.582">切った</span><span begin="54.582" end="54.867">け</span><span begin="54.867" end="56.161">ど</span></p><p begin="54.777" end="56.572" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="54.777" end="55.001">知る</span><span begin="55.001" end="55.225">か？</span> <span begin="55.225" end="55.464">汁</span><span begin="55.464" end="55.672">なら</span> <span begin="55.672" end="55.930">drink</span> <span begin="55.930" end="56.044">up</span> <span begin="56.044" end="56.177">we're</span> <span begin="56.177" end="56.393">still</span> <span begin="56.393" end="56.572">tough</span></p><p begin="56.528" end="59.852" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.528" end="57.147">最低</span><span begin="57.147" end="57.367">な</span><span begin="57.367" end="57.782">コンプ</span><span begin="57.782" end="57.992">だ</span><span begin="57.992" end="58.295">し</span> <span begin="58.428" end="58.844">最高</span><span begin="58.844" end="59.095">の</span><span begin="59.095" end="59.474">昆布</span><span begin="59.474" end="59.852">だし</span></p><p begin="59.862" end="1:03.164" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.862" end="1:00.313">揃っ</span><span begin="1:00.313" end="1:00.734">てる</span><span begin="1:00.734" end="1:01.385">だけ</span><span begin="1:01.385" end="1:01.564">じゃ</span><span begin="1:01.564" end="1:02.417">つま</span><span begin="1:02.417" end="1:02.835">らん</span><span begin="1:02.835" end="1:03.164">し</span></p><p begin="1:03.174" end="1:06.601" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.174" end="1:03.646">繋い</span><span begin="1:03.646" end="1:04.029">だって</span><span begin="1:04.029" end="1:04.552">綻</span><span begin="1:04.552" end="1:04.946">ぶし</span> <span begin="1:05.129" end="1:05.621">しょっぱい</span><span begin="1:05.621" end="1:05.721">な</span><span begin="1:05.721" end="1:06.601">鰹節</span></p><p begin="1:06.611" end="1:09.352" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.611" end="1:07.084">もっ</span><span begin="1:07.084" end="1:07.402">と</span><span begin="1:07.402" end="1:07.762">甘</span><span begin="1:07.762" end="1:08.119">えたい</span><span begin="1:08.119" end="1:08.393">け</span><span begin="1:08.393" end="1:09.352">どー？</span></p></div><div begin="1:09.362" end="1:26.041" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:09.362" end="1:12.976"